  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Appraisal of Danish Support to the UNEP Copenhagen Climate Centre (2026-2030)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DK has contributed to the development of the UNEP-CCC (former UNEP-DTU) for more than 30 years and it has established itself as an internationally recognised climate centre. While building on the established a unique position and network in the international climate architecture, the recent changes in geopolitics, climate negotiations and the international donor landscape also calls for adopting new approaches. The appraisal should assess the compliance to AMG, the quality of the results framework, alignment to the new Danish Strategy for Development Cooperation and how it is fit for purpose in a more volatile multilateral framework.</narrative>
  </description>
